#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:5 55b23b85f96349f2976983f349e15a48
msgid "Using GPS for Altitude Sensing"
msgstr "使用 GPS 进行高度感测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:7 28d7fa02946d43bfa52d2cc57fba6546
msgid ""
"It is possible to boot an autopilot without barometer present, and use GPS "
"(outdoor use) or other altitude sensor (rangefinder, range beacon) for "
"indoor use."
msgstr "可以在没有气压计的情况下启动飞控，并使用 GPS（室外使用）或其他高度传感器（测距仪、测距信标）进行室内使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:9 19e01b1e14d547bfac901986099451df
msgid ""
"Without a barometer as a backup sensor, loss of the primary altitude sensor "
"can result in a crash if in an altitude holding mode or autonomous mode. Be "
"prepared to switch to a non altitude holding mode in case of loss of primary"
" sensor."
msgstr "没有气压计作为备用传感器，在高度保持模式或自主模式下主高度传感器丢失可能导致坠机。请准备好在主传感器丢失时切换到非高度保持模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:12
#: ffaa7d8448b742d38734ab5ac0c47936
msgid "Setup for using a non Baro Source for Altitude Measurement"
msgstr "使用非气压计源进行高度测量的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:14
#: 136017bddcc14142bab99a1822bd7908
msgid "If using EKF2:"
msgstr "如果使用 EKF2："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:16
#: 71fd560425c54bfca11425b7b16a85c7
msgid "Set the :ref:`EK2_ALT_SOURCE<EK2_ALT_SOURCE>` parameter to 2 (GPS)."
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK2_ALT_SOURCE<EK2_ALT_SOURCE>` 参数设置为 2（GPS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:18
#: 3c57822efe074d0f82b2030f72e64379
msgid "If using EKF3:"
msgstr "如果使用 EKF3："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:20
#: a6be6dddb9994eaca9223d79685d93b5
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>`, "
":ref:`EK3_SRC2_POSZ<EK3_SRC2_POSZ>`, and  "
":ref:`EK3_SRC3_POSZ<EK3_SRC3_POSZ>` parameters to 3 (GPS)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>`、:ref:`EK3_SRC2_POSZ<EK3_SRC2_POSZ>` 和 "
":ref:`EK3_SRC3_POSZ<EK3_SRC3_POSZ>` 参数设置为 3（GPS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:22
#: ce75c61e0e4e44aba599653c6ac12f5a
msgid "In addition:"
msgstr "此外："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-alt.rst:24
#: fd208e24546042bf825148b999295225
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE<AHRS_GPS_USE>` to 2 (Use GPS for DCM position and "
"height)."
msgstr "将 :ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE<AHRS_GPS_USE>` 设置为 2（使用 GPS 进行 DCM 位置和高度）。"
